cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use HejjéTrac in research, cite the release or commit you used and
  the original FicTrac method listed in references. Use a version-specific
  Zenodo DOI when one is available for your release.
type: software
version: "0.2.3"
date-released: "2026-10-26"
title: "HejjéTrac: native spherical-motion tracking"
abstract: >-
  A native Rust reworking of FicTrac for tracking patterned spherical
  treadmills and reconstructing fictive animal paths. Includes a desktop
  application, guided calibration, independent rig sessions, recording,
  live outputs, a command-line interface and local agent protocols.
authors:
